# Packages for the congress job of .github/workflows/stocks.yml only: it reads
# the House periodic transaction reports (public PDFs) with pypdf, with no
# secret and no other package. The private analyze job of the same workflow
# installs requirements-brief.lock (the Anthropic SDK and PyYAML); the stock
# analysis itself (scripts/stocks/) uses the standard library only.
#
# 6.9.2 was published on 2026-03-23; 7.0.0 and 7.0.1 (November 2026) are too
# new to pin.
#
# Regenerate with Python 3.12 and pip-tools:
#   pip-compile --generate-hashes --allow-unsafe -o requirements-stocks.lock requirements-stocks.in
# and install with:
#   pip install --require-hashes --only-binary :all: -r requirements-stocks.lock
pypdf==6.9.2
